  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Vulnerability to Modern Slavery in Key Border Towns in Nicaragua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to ensure the protection of migrants from modern slavery by facilitating information services on the risks of irregular migration through the information hubs. This aim will be accomplished by strengthening the capacities of local partners to improve the management of the information hubs in Chinandega, Rivas and Nueva Segovia. Moreover, this initiative seeks to develop capacity building actions to involve new partners such as local governments and the private sector for the creation of information hubs in Chinandega, Rivas (Cardenas) and Nueva Segovia (Jalapa).</narrative>
  </description>
